      ],
      "implementationNotes": [
        "Source Meat Slap is a 120-second tag timer: least time holding the meat wins; holder has Speed IV and Sharpness X porkchop; transfer requires the source 6.5-damage threshold.",
        "The previous holder relocates to an original marker at least 24 blocks from the tagged player. The port pairs attacker and victim within this session instead of using global damage-stat selectors.",
        "If the holder leaves, a remaining player becomes the holder. Out-of-bounds or unexpected death returns to the starting position instead of eliminating the player; this is a same-server recovery adaptation."
      ],
      "disconnectBehavior": "Disconnecting or leaving before results forfeits this server's match: remove the player from pending rankings and continue, ending when fewer than two remain. Published results are frozen. Original end functions sometimes wait for every participant to reconnect; this port does not.",
