      "name": "Runner (Rn)",
      "category": "free_for_all",
      "sourceFunction": "runner",
      "status": "implemented_phase_2",
      "nameZhSource": "踏碎狂奔",
      "defaultDifficulty": "normal",
      "difficultyPolicy": "Normal where the source has difficulty branches; fixed source rules otherwise. No difficulty selector or single-player variant is exposed.",
      "geometryResources": [
        "runner_small",
        "runner_large",
        "runner_shell"
      ],
      "implementationNotes": [
        "Original 16x16 or 22x22 two-floor layout is selected by player count; stepped planks change color and fall after 40 ticks.",
        "Falling blocks damage players but do not destroy lower oak planks; active source cleanup only removes landed colored blocks. No extra floor-destruction mechanic is invented.",
        "The normal 10-tick stillness check is used after a 40-tick grace period; the source high-ping 20-tick check is not exposed. Source crouch and walking counters are retained."
      ],
      "disconnectBehavior": "Disconnecting or leaving before results forfeits this server's match: remove the player from pending rankings and continue, ending when fewer than two remain. Published results are frozen. Original end functions sometimes wait for every participant to reconnect; this port does not.",
